      "height": 112.5,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "web      serves the pages you click on\nworker   builds the audio, and polls\n         the mailbox\n\nBoth share ./data. There is no command\nline: the app is the whole interface.",
      "originalText": "web      serves the pages you click on\nworker   builds the audio, and polls\n         the mailbox\n\nBoth share ./data. There is no command\nline: the app is the whole interface.",
