      "y": 1056,
      "width": 492,
      "height": 131.25,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "text": "Change a word\n  the ids stay, so the audio survives.\n\nRemove a block\n  every id after it moves, so the audio\n  has to be made again \u2014 but from the\n  cache, not from the model.",
      "originalText": "Change a word\n  the ids stay, so the audio survives.\n\nRemove a block\n  every id after it moves, so the audio\n  has to be made again \u2014 but from the\n  cache, not from the model.",
